  "final_span": "aged 5 and 8.\nForeign Minister Avigdor Liberman (Ichud Leumi) also reacted to the reports on Twitter, writing this morning: \"I am in shock over the horror in Toulouse. The news reported four dead \u2013 three children, I pray there is no fifth victim: students. The victims were shot at a school. This is just the latest result of the state of Israel abandoning its educational emissaries [shaliachim] throughout the world. I call for the return of the children to the country.\"\nfighting for my life, I was in shock and couldn't believe what was happening,\" he said.\nfor people who, until yesterday, were part of the life of the school.\"\nThe incident happened around 08:00 local time (06:00 GMT).\nand was believed to be heading for another jewish school, reports said.\nparents is suspected, reports said, although one may be incorrect.\nschool. The request is being rendered in English.\nposted on Twitter as he traveled for a television appearance in Paris.\njournalist what he hoped would be \"a peaceful visit.\"\ncommunities have reacted with horror and sadness at the news.\npicture carried by the Gazeta Dela Gazetna Romania.\nPhilippe Karsenty founded and currently serves as the President of Media-Ratings.\nhave their own needs to meet and cannot be ashamed to defend them.\nGoldstone's mission or Britagne is dispatching a commission.\nworld, maybe they can feel empathy.\nChief of Staff, along with Major General Ido Nehushtan.\narmed Swat corpses found in the area.\nBangladesh passed away after being in a coma for 199 days at a Paris hospital.\ngave to the Nazis and to the Communists is the freedom of Jewish Reparation.\nAnd that is its real name. It is genuine freedom speech, freedom for fools, for Jews, and the melting pot.\nToledo faces a curfew starting at midnight because of the Jewish murders in Toulouse!\nrant of a soul but he's really gotten something done here.\nMr. Vidal's words",
